<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Hesapmatik - Şifremi Unuttum</title>
    <!-- Google Fonts: Poppins -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <style>
        /* Genel Sayfa ve Reset */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body, html {
            height: 100%;
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        /* Ana İki Sütunlu Konteyner */
        .login-split-container {
            display: flex;
            width: 100vw;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        /* Sol Taraf: Mint Yeşili ve Krem Tonları */
        .login-left-panel {
            flex: 3;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #134e4a 0%, #065f46 100%);
            color: #fdfbf7;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 80px;
            position: relative;
        }

        /* Marka Başlığı */
        .brand-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 60px;
        }

        .logo-icon {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-right: 15px;
        }

        .brand-header h1 {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            letter-spacing: 3px;
            color: #6ee7b7;
            margin: 0;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        /* Büyük Hero Metni */
        .hero-text-wrapper {
            line-height: 1.1;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .hero-line {
            font-size: 4rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #fdfbf7;
        }

        .hero-line.highlight-green {
            color: #34d399;
        }

        .hero-line.highlight-blue {
            color: #a7f3d0;
        }

        .hero-subtext {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            color: #a7f3d0;
            max-width: 500px;
            font-weight: 300;
        }

        /* Sağ Taraf: Kart Alanı */
        .login-right-panel {
            flex: 2;
            background-color: #f9f8f6;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 40px;
        }

        /* Alttan Kayarak Gelme Animasyonu */
        @keyframes slideUpFade {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(30px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .login-card {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 450px;
            background: #ffffff;
            padding: 40px 50px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(6, 95, 70, 0.08);
            border: 1px solid #f0ede6;
            animation: slideUpFade 0.4s ease-out forwards;
        }

        .login-card h2 {
            text-align: center;
            color: #065f46;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            font-size: 2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        /* Giriş Formu Elemanları */
        .input-group {
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .input-group label {
            display: block;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
            color: #374151;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .input-group input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px 15px;
            border: 2px solid #e5e7eb;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif;
            outline: none;
            transition: border-color 0.2s;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            background-color: #fcfbf9;
        }

        .input-group input:focus {
            border-color: #059669;
            background-color: #ffffff;
        }

        /* Buton */
        .btn-login {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 15px;
            background: linear-gradient(45deg, #065f46, #047857);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: opacity 0.2s, transform 0.1s;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .btn-login:hover {
            opacity: 0.95;
        }

        .btn-login:active {
            transform: scale(0.98);
        }

        /* Alt Linkler */
        .login-links {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            margin-top: 25px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }

        .login-links a {
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .register-link {
            color: #059669;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        .register-link:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        /* Mobil Uyumluluk */
        @media (max-width: 992px) {
            .login-split-container {
                flex-direction: column;
            }

            .login-left-panel {
                padding: 40px;
                text-align: center;
                align-items: center;
                flex: none;
            }

            .brand-header {
                margin-bottom: 20px;
            }

            .hero-line {
                font-size: 2.5rem;
            }

            .login-right-panel {
                flex: none;
                padding: 20px;
            }
            
            .login-card {
                box-shadow: none;
                padding: 30px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="login-split-container">
        <!-- Sol Taraf: Tanıtım ve Slogan Alanı -->
        <div class="login-left-panel">
            <div class="brand-header">
                <div class="logo-icon">✨</div>
                <h1>HESAPMATİK</h1>
            </div>
            
            <div class="hero-text-wrapper">
                <p class="hero-line">Alacak</p>
                <p class="hero-line highlight-green">verecek</p>
                <p class="hero-line">takibinin</p>
                <p class="hero-line highlight-blue">en akıllı yolu</p>
            </div>
            <p class="hero-subtext">Finansal dengenizi saniyeler içinde kontrol altına alın.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Sağ Taraf: Şifre Sıfırlama Kartı -->
        <div class="login-right-panel">
            <div class="login-card">
                <h2>Şifreni mi Unuttun?</h2>
                <p style="color: #6b7280; font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
                    Kullanıcı adını veya e-postanı gir, sana şifre yenileme bağlantısı gönderelim.
                </p>
                <form action="/forgot-password" method="POST">
                    <div class="input-group">
                        <label>Kullanıcı Adı veya E-posta</label>
                        <input type="text" name="email" placeholder="Kayıtlı bilgilerinizi girin" required>
                    </div>
                    
                    <button type="submit" class="btn-login">Bağlantı Gönder</button>
                </form>
                
                <div class="login-links" style="justify-content: center; margin-top: 25px;">
                    <a href="/login" class="forgot-password">← <span class="register-link">Giriş sayfasına dön</span></a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>